[0.012, "o", "\u001b[20B\u001b[27m============================================================\r\n Demo 1: traffic spike and autoscaling\r\n \b\n What you're about to see: the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service sitting\r\n idle at 0 replicas, a burst of 15 concurrent requests\r\n hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n============================================================\r\n \u001b[H"]
