[1.285, "o", "\r\u001b[18B\u001b[49mpods running: 0\r\n \b\n \u001b[19;96H\r\n\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K What you're about to see: the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service sitting\r\n\u001b[K idle at 0 replicas, a burst of 15 concurrent requests\r\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K============================================================\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[19;96H"]
[5.017, "o", "\r\n\n\u001b[K What you're about to see: the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service sitting\r\n\u001b[K idle at 0 replicas, a burst of 15 concurrent requests\r\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K============================================================\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[19;96H\r\n\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K============================================================\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### firing 15 concurrent workers for 25s -- watch the top pane scale out\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[19;96H"]
[0.493, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[97m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m\u001b[31m\u001b[40m\u001b[91m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[97m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m\u001b[31m\u001b[40m\u001b[91m\u001b[1m\u001b[6;11H\u001b[37m\u001b[97m70%\u001b[31m\u001b[91m↑\u001b[4D\n\u001b[37m\u001b[97m80%\u001b[31m\u001b[91m↑"]
